# Codex Local — example environment file.
#
# The API key is stored in the OS keychain (Electron safeStorage) whenever
# available. This file is ONLY a fallback for headless/unsupported systems.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in your key. `.env` is gitignored and is never
# written to the repository.
#
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys  (the `:free` models do not
# require a paid plan — a free-tier key is enough).

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-REPLACE_ME

# Optional: override the HTTP-Referer header sent to OpenRouter.
# CODEX_LOCAL_REFERER=http://localhost:5173

# Optional: override where the local SQLite database is written.
# CODEX_LOCAL_DATA_DIR=
